{"availability":"available","full":"wieslawsoltes/WinMe","name":"WinMe","description":"Windows Millennium Edition desktop recreated in the browser with modular HTML and JavaScript — 60 applications and control panels, a persistent virtual drive and a WebGPU renderer with WebGL2 and Canvas 2D fallbacks.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-10-04T16:46:31Z","updated":"2026-10-04T16:55:37Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://wieslawsoltes.github.io/WinMe/","topics":["browser-os","desktop-environment","es-modules","github-pages","javascript","millennium-edition","retro","web-desktop","webgl2","webgpu","windows","windows-me"],"demo":"https://wieslawsoltes.github.io/WinMe/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:52.569Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:52.569Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:52.569Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:05.332Z","stars":3,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:46:52.569Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live demo: — The Deploy to GitHub Pages workflow publishes dist/ on every push to main.","A modular HTML/JavaScript reimplementation of the Windows Millennium Edition desktop. The application includes 60 registered applications and control-panel entries, a persistent virtual drive, classic window management, and a WebGPU compute renderer with WebGL 2 and Canvas 2D fallbacks.","This is a browser desktop, not a complete Windows Me operating system. It does not execute arbitrary Windows binaries or implement the Windows kernel, drivers, Win32 ABI, DirectX, or physical hardware services. The interface follows Windows Me visual references, but exhaustive pixel and feature parity has not been established. See COMPATIBILITY.md for the precise boundary."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/WinMe/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cc3f7294df85f7abf3614999dd37d2735ee6442ecd1db